Usage: cortex [options] [command]

Manage Cortex Memory deployments and administrative operations

Options:
  -V, --version                  output the version number
  -d, --deployment <name>        Deployment alias from configuration
  -f, --format <format>          Output format: table, json, csv
  --quiet                        Suppress diagnostic hints
  --debug                        Show diagnostic details on stderr
  --scope-user <id>              Explicit caller scope user (not a
                                 target/filter)
  --tenant <id>                  Exact tenant scope (ordinary operations require
                                 --scope-user)
  --token-env <name>             Host JWT environment variable name (default
                                 CORTEX_AUTH_TOKEN)
  --token-file <path>            Current-owner private regular JWT file, reread
                                 per operation
  --tenant-id <id>               Verified runtime tenant selector
  --memory-space-id <id>         Verified runtime space selector
  --graph-sync <mode>            Graph policy: auto, off, required
  -h, --help                     display help for command

Commands:
  start [options]                Compatibility alias for foreground dev
  stop [options]                 Retired global supervisor; never inspects or
                                 kills processes
  deploy [options]               Deploy only the explicitly selected native
                                 target
  update [options]               Plan/apply selected dependency versions
                                 (default pinned SDK 0.39.0 + Convex 1.46.0
                                 pair)
  status [options]               Read-only selected target diagnostics; unknown
                                 states remain explicit
  doctor [options]               Read-only native configuration, prerequisites
                                 and backend diagnostics
  config [options]               Manage CLI configuration
  use [options] [deployment]     Set current deployment for this
                                 project/directory
  init [options] [directory]     Create a basic or backend-only Cortex project
  install [options] [directory]  Install Cortex SDK into an existing standalone
                                 npm project
  graph [options]                Set up and manage one selected project's
                                 optional graph
  schema [options]               Inspect and synchronize the installed SDK
                                 backend source
  templates [options]            List, install and update independently
                                 versioned templates
  db [options]                   Native deployment snapshots and honest scoped
                                 statistics
  backend [options]              Additive backend runtime setup and verified
                                 development provisioning
  dev [options]                  Run one selected project's foreground native
                                 Convex child
  convex [options]               Selected project's installed native Convex 1.46
                                 management
  snapshot [options]             Protected restore (deferred; unsupported in
                                 this release)
  completion [options] <shell>   Generate shell completion script
  help [command]                 display help for command

Memory Operations:
  memory                      Manage memories (vector store)
  users                       Manage user profiles and data
  spaces                      Manage memory spaces
  facts                       Manage extracted facts
  conversations|convs         Manage conversations

